5,1,1,talk,May,,Hi everyone! Let's get this sorted. I want to make sure we aren't just sticking the burden on one person again. What should we look into first?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We need a logical approach to ensure the solution is sustainable for everyone living here. Let's examine the actual impact of different setups.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready to help! I want to know how much this stuff actually costs so we can be fair about the money. Let's find some clues!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to see everyone. I just hope we can find a way that keeps us all on friendly terms. Harmony is the most important thing.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"A wise start, indeed. Let us look not only at the physical space but at the time and spirit we invest in our neighborhood.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll check the ""Measurements of the five frontages"" and the ""Ward complaint log for this point."" I want to see who's been suffering the most.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll look into the ""Visit to the station block's bin house"" and ""Supervised mornings on the next lane"" to see how those options actually feel.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm going for the ""Block ledger of refuse-point expenses"" and ""Ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs""! I'll handle the money research!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'll check the ""Statements at the residents' meeting"" and ""The station block's meeting minutes."" I want to know if these plans cause arguments.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall examine the ""Truck arrival time from the crew leader"" and the ""Ward filing requirements per the installations clerk"" to understand the labor involved.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, you're so energetic! I hope you find some clear numbers for us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, I appreciate you looking into the administrative side. It's often the part people forget until it's too late.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll find everything! I bet we can find a way to make it cheap and awesome for everyone!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm a bit nervous about what the meeting minutes will say, but it's better to know now than later.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Knowledge is the foundation of peace, Midori. We shall all return with the truths we have uncovered.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
