34,2,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,May,,"Wow, it's worse than I thought. One house has filed almost all the complaints! Also, some of our frontages are way too narrow for a bin.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I found that the station block's bin house smells terrible in summer because you can't wash it. Also, supervising mornings takes about fifty minutes each.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"I found out we spend 34,000 yen a year just on nets and deodorants! And new shelters are really expensive, even with the 40% subsidy.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried. The station block started fighting over who sweeps the bin house. Also, people said they wouldn't actually turn away a neighbor's late bag.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The truck arrives very early, sometimes before 7:40. Also, the paperwork for a permanent build is quite tedious, requiring five signatures and months of waiting.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, if the bin house smells that bad, maybe a structure isn't the answer. But we can't just leave it where it is if the space is unfair.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, exactly. And @Servas, that early truck time makes ""supervised hours"" sound like a real pain for whoever has to wake up.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, if people are already fighting over sweeping, maybe we should avoid anything that needs a lot of cleaning!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, that's a good point. I just don't want us to end up in another row. If we can't agree on who polices the bags, that's a problem.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we are discovering that every ""solution"" carries its own burden. We must weigh the cost of money against the cost of time and harmony.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Servas, you're right. If the paperwork is a nightmare and the space is limited, we need a plan that doesn't just shift the stress around.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, the fact that people won't police each other suggests that a managed window might just lead to more resentment.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"But we're spending 34,000 yen a year on things that aren't even working! We have to change something to save money.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree we need change, Kenji, but not if it means we stop speaking to each other. A permanent structure sounds like a recipe for more fights.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,The early hour of the truck is a significant constraint. It asks a sacrifice of sleep that not everyone may be willing or able to give.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
